-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094344\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 40,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>The Song of Ice and Steel</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration_Quest\" title=\"Exploration Quest\">Exploration Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Upphaf_Forest_Ruins\" title=\"Upphaf Forest Ruins\">Upphaf Forest Ruins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Roya_Frostlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Roya Frostlands\">Roya Frostlands</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing the quest will award the player <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Item_A_Forest_Waking_Up.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Item A Forest Waking Up.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"30\" data-height=\"30\">A Forest Waking Up</span></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Item_A_Forest_Waking_Up.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Item A Forest Waking Up.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"30\" data-height=\"30\">A Forest Waking Up</span></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <span class=\"new\" title=\"A Forest Waking Up (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQV9Gb3Jlc3RfV2FraW5nX1VwP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">A Forest Waking Up</span></span></span> and <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Item_A_Forest_Buried_Deep.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Item A Forest Buried Deep.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"30\" data-height=\"30\">A Forest Buried Deep</span></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Item_A_Forest_Buried_Deep.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Item A Forest Buried Deep.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"30\" data-height=\"30\">A Forest Buried Deep</span></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <span class=\"new\" title=\"A Forest Buried Deep (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQV9Gb3Jlc3RfQnVyaWVkX0RlZXA/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">A Forest Buried Deep</span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Though buried deep beneath the snow, the rusted iron bird still longs to sing.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<p><span class=\"text-error\">Transcription missing</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The quest's title is a reference to epic fantasy series <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Song_of_Ice_and_Fire\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:A Song of Ice and Fire\"><i>A Song of Ice and Fire</i></a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>The Song of Ice and Steel</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/3.1\" title=\"Version/3.1\">Version 3.1</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Song_of_Ice_and_Steel/Change_H